### ============================================================
### HEALTH
### ============================================================

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

###

### ============================================================
### INGESTION
### ============================================================

### Upload test PDF
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ingestion/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="source"

local-test
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="finance_test.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./storage/documents/finance_test.pdf
--boundary--

###

### Upload Apple 10-K 2024
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ingestion/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="source"

https://investor.apple.com
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="10-Q4-2024-As-Filed.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./storage/documents/10-Q4-2024-As-Filed.pdf
--boundary--

###

### List all ingested documents
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ingestion/documents

###

### Delete test PDF
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ingestion/documents/finance_test.pdf

###

### Delete Apple 10-K
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ingestion/documents/10-Q4-2024-As-Filed.pdf

###

### ============================================================
### RETRIEVAL (chunks only, no generation)
### ============================================================

### Search — net sales
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/retrieval/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What was Apple total net sales in 2024?",
  "top_n": 5
}

###

### Search — services revenue
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/retrieval/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Apple services revenue 2024",
  "top_n": 5
}

###

### Search — geographic segments
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/retrieval/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Apple revenue by geographic segment Americas Europe China",
  "top_n": 5
}

###

### Search — risk factors
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/retrieval/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Apple risk factors 2024",
  "top_n": 5
}

