### ============================================================
### EVALUATION (LLM-as-judge — gemma3:4b scores the answer)
### ============================================================

### Eval — grounded answer (should score high)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/generation/eval
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What was Apple total net sales in 2024?",
  "answer": "According to the 2024 annual report, Apple reported total net sales of 391 billion dollars in fiscal year 2024, representing a 2 percent increase from the prior year."
}

###

### Eval — hallucinated answer (should score low)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/generation/eval
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What was Apple total net sales in 2024?",
  "answer": "Apple reported net sales of 800 billion dollars in 2024 and acquired Tesla and Microsoft during the year."
}

###

### Eval — partial answer (should score medium)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/generation/eval
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What was Apple total net sales in 2024?",
  "answer": "Apple had strong revenue in 2024 driven by iPhone and Services segments."
}

###

### Eval — services revenue answer
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/generation/eval
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What was Apple services revenue in 2024?",
  "answer": "Apple services revenue reached 96 billion dollars in fiscal year 2024, growing 13 percent year over year. Services include the App Store, Apple Music, iCloud, and Apple TV+."
}

###

### Eval — geographic answer
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/generation/eval
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "How much revenue did Apple generate in Greater China?",
  "answer": "Apple generated 67 billion dollars in revenue from Greater China in fiscal year 2024, down from 73 billion dollars in fiscal year 2023."
}

###
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/retrieval/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What was Apple total net sales in 2024?",
  "top_n": 5
}

###
### Generate — total net sales (retry)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/generation/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What was Apple total net sales in fiscal year 2024? The answer should be in the financial statements as Total net sales."
}

### Generate — total net sales (with audit)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/generation/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What was Apple total net sales in fiscal year 2024?",
  "client_id": "graham-test"
}

### ============================================================
### AUDIT
### ============================================================

### Get all query audit events
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/audit/queries

###

### Get query events filtered by client
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/audit/queries?client_id=graham-test

###

### Get low faithfulness queries (potential hallucinations)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/audit/queries?max_faithfulness=0.5

###

### Get all ingestion audit events
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/audit/ingestions

###

### Get failed ingestions only
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/audit/ingestions?status=error

###

### Paginate audit events
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/audit/queries?limit=10&offset=0